#: ../../source/getting_started/installation/vke.rst:42
msgid ""
"The gateway discovers models only in its configured installation namespace. "
"These samples use ``aibrix-system``, matching the default installation. If "
"you select another workload namespace, update the sample namespaces, "
"commands, and any referenced Secrets together. For Helm, set "
"``gatewayPlugin.installationNamespace`` to that existing namespace; the "
"chart configures the gateway argument and discovery permissions together."
msgstr ""
"网关仅发现其配置的安装命名空间中的模型。这些示例使用 ``aibrix-"
"system``，与默认安装保持一致。如果选择其他工作负载命名空间，请同时更新示例中的命名空间、命令以及引用的 Secret。对于 Helm，请将 "
"``gatewayPlugin.installationNamespace`` 设置为该已存在的命名空间；Chart 会同时配置网关参数和发现权限。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation/vke.rst:49
msgid ""
"Save yaml as `model.yaml` and run `kubectl apply -n aibrix-system -f "
"model.yaml`."
msgstr ""
"将 YAML 保存为 `model.yaml`，然后运行 `kubectl apply -n aibrix-system -f model.yaml`。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation/vke.rst:57
msgid ""
"Save yaml as `pd-model.yaml` and run `kubectl apply -n aibrix-system -f pd-"
"model.yaml`."
msgstr ""
"将 YAML 保存为 `pd-model.yaml`，然后运行 `kubectl apply -n aibrix-system -f pd-"
"model.yaml`。"
